The enrichment fetch can't be included. It needs `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, and the node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/state-read@0.1.0`, so a component importing it is rejected at link time. I removed the fetch and the import, so the node uses only `state-read` and its output is unchanged. To add the fetch, the `with` clause itself has to be extended to include the HTTP capability.

